> its own it tried the statement about all the ladders on about 1.7 million small markings and found no exception. Lean has accepted that statement too. This time I wrote the Lean statements myself, 
> two of them, before any Lean proof of them existed: the statement itself and a more general one from which its proof draws it; two fresh instances wrote the proofs; a third tested the statements and 
